      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2021-07-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "One of the actors in the play being put on by the student council is injured, and the search is on for an emergency stand-in. As the opening of the curtain draws nearer and nearer, Catarina ends up agreeing to fill the role at Sophia's request. She's given a script with a story that sounds very familiar, and then her time comes to take the stage.",
