      "episode": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "released": "2021-07-31T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The day after the resolution of Catarina Claes's kidnapping, the first prince, Jeffrey Stuart, passionately speaks of his love for his younger brothers to his fiancée, Susanna Randall. At the same time, Geordo and Alan are in the student council office, reminiscing about their childhood days with their older brothers.",
